  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 83(b), Dr. Okafor recognizes $600,000 of ordinary income at grant ($20 x 30,000 shares), and the $1,800,000 of subsequent appreciation ($60 x 30,000) is taxed as long-term capital gain at 20%. Option 2 equity tax totals $582,000 versus Option 1''s $1,110,000 on the $3,000,000 NQSO spread taxed entirely as ordinary income at 37%.
